  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 321116021657600
    m_Localized: Ascension|Increases own level by 1. Increases max Mana by 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116034240512
    m_Localized: Promotion|Select an ally piece. Transforms into that piece while
      retaining own level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116034240513
    m_Localized: Self Destruct|Deals damage equal to 2x current HP to all pieces
      within skill range. Reduces own HP to 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116034240514
    m_Localized: Pinpoint Attack|Select an enemy piece. Attacks it once and reduces
      its Defense by 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434816
    m_Localized: Battlecry|Restores 2 Mana to all allies within skill range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434817
    m_Localized: Pray|Restores HP equal to 2x Attack Power to all allies within skill
      range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434818
    m_Localized: Disarm|Reduces the Attack Power of all enemies within attack range
      by 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434819
    m_Localized: Bombard|Attacks enemies within attack range. Deals identical damage
      and reduces Defense by 1 for all enemies within skill range around the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434820
    m_Localized: Castling|Select an ally piece. Increases its Defense by 1 and swaps
      positions with it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434821
    m_Localized: Barriacde|Select a tile within movement range. Summons an obstacle
      at that location.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434822
    m_Localized: Evolution|All ally Unicorns attack immediately. Transforms 1 ally
      Knight into a Unicorn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434823
    m_Localized: Encourge|Increases the Attack Power of all allies within skill range
      by 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434824
    m_Localized: CheckMate|Deals damage equal to 5x spent Mana to enemies within
      attack range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434825
    m_Localized: Region|Select a tile within movement range to summon a random piece.
      After 2 casts, all subsequently summoned pieces have their level increased
      by 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434826
    m_Localized: Upgrade|(Preparation Phase Only) Select a piece to permanently increase
      its level by 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434827
    m_Localized: Lightning|Deals damage equal to 25% of Max HP to all pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434828
    m_Localized: Healing Potion|Select a piece. Fully restores its HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434829
    m_Localized: Mana Potion|Select a piece. Fully restores its Mana.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434830
    m_Localized: Corrode|Select a piece. Reduces its Defense by 2.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434831
    m_Localized: Protection|Select a piece. Increases its Defense by 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434832
    m_Localized: Overdrive|Reduces Defense of all pieces by 1. Increases their Attack
      Power by 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434833
    m_Localized: Overload|Select a piece. Instantly triggers its skill. The skill
      target is chosen at random.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434834
    m_Localized: Optimized|Select a piece. Reduces its Max Mana by 1.(Cannot be reduced
      below 1.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434835
    m_Localized: Warp|Select a piece. Select a tile. Moves the piece to that location.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321116038434836
    m_Localized: Ambush|Select a piece. Attacks immediately once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
